Read the table in "spending.csv" and call it spending.
Let groceries be 400.
Let eating out be 150.
Let transport be 120.
Let fun be 100.
Total the amount per month.
Total the amount per category.
Show spending.
For each category and amount in spending:
  IF category is "groceries" and amount > groceries then show category and amount - groceries.
  IF category is "eating out" and amount > eating out then show category and amount - eating out.
  IF category is "transport" and amount > transport then show category and amount - transport.
  IF category is "fun" and amount > fun then show category and amount - fun.
Make a bar chart of spending called "months.svg".
